Xn; - Find again
X 
X     The ';'  (semicolon)  command  causes  the previous pattern to be
Xsearched for again.   This  is  more  convenient  that  entering  'F$'
Xagain.   The  'n'  has  the  same meaning, positive searches forwards,
Xnegative backwards. 
